From 82f132ca5d573637ee2d4cf30525a22afcdf3e15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:37:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): debug info logs the frame rate on a change and
 docks as a tab

The frame-rate rule reads the frame stamps the shell already takes: one
line for a new level, at most one summary (min, max, mean) each 10 s while
it keeps moving, nothing while idle. The gpu slow-frame line uses the same
10 s limit. The Debug info panel is a dock tab (dock, tab, float, close).

Fixes #2262

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
